<title>USA: American unit has taste-masked Ketoprofen.</title>
<headline>American unit has taste-masked Ketoprofen.</headline>
<dateline>DAYTON, Ohio 1997-03-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Eurand America Inc, a unit of American Home Products, said Friday it had developed a taste-masked form of ketoprofen, an anti-inflammatory drug.</p>
<p>It said ketoprofen is indicated to relieve pain and reduce fever.</p>
</text>
